  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Simit dough is a simple, moderately hydrated lean bread dough. What distinguishes simit from any other bread ring is the coating: each shaped ring is dipped in diluted treacle before being rolled in sesame seeds, so the seeds bond tightly to the sticky surface and bake to a deep, nutty golden. Use the full quantity of seeds and coat each ring thoroughly so the surface is completely covered with no bare patches."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "ingredientsList",
        "attrs": {
          "items": [
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "strong-bread-flour",
              "amount": 500,
